        "Graph each linear inequality."
      ],
      "text": "Use the set of ordered pairs to ⓐ determine whether the relation is a function, ⓑ find the domain of the relation, and ⓒ find the range of the relation. \\({ ( -3 , 27 ) , ( -2 , 8 ) , ( -1 , 1 ) , ( 0 , 0 ) ,\\) \\(( 1 , 1 ) , ( 2 , 8 ) , ( 3 , 27 ) }\\)",
      "math": [
        "{ ( -3 , 27 ) , ( -2 , 8 ) , ( -1 , 1 ) , ( 0 , 0 ) ,",
        "( 1 , 1 ) , ( 2 , 8 ) , ( 3 , 27 ) }"
